<title>UK: Haven Funding prices 47.3 mln stg fungible bond.</title>
<headline>Haven Funding prices 47.3 mln stg fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has beem priced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAVEN FUNDING PLC</p>
<p> AMT    47.3 MLN STG  COUPON     8.125     MATURITY    30.SEP.37</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *104.1641  PAY DATE   *05.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   YIELD	7.768 PCT SPREAD	+73 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2021 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 107.5 MLN STG BOND</p>
<p>	    * PLUS 147 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		AVERAGE LIFE 23.AUG.30</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
